.\" UDF driver man page
.TH UDF 4 "January 2026" "Substrate Kernel" "Special Files"
.SH NAME
udf \- Universal Disk Format filesystem driver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mount -t udf
.I device mountpoint
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B udf
driver provides read-write support for Universal Disk Format filesystems.
.SS Structures
The driver defines the following on-disk structures in
.IR udf.h :
.TP
.B struct udf_tag
16-byte descriptor tag with CRC verification.
.TP
.B struct udf_avdp
Anchor Volume Descriptor Pointer.
.TP
.B struct udf_pvd, udf_pd, udf_lvd
Volume descriptors (Primary, Partition, Logical).
.TP
.B struct udf_fsd
File Set Descriptor containing root directory location.
.TP
.B struct udf_fe, udf_efe
File Entry and Extended File Entry (inode equivalents).
.TP
.B struct udf_fid
File Identifier Descriptor (directory entry).
.SS Read Operations
.TP
.B udf_find_avdp()
Locate Anchor at sector 256, the last sector, or the last sector minus 256.
.TP
.B udf_read_vds()
Parse Volume Descriptor Sequence.
.TP
.B udf_read_fe()
Read File Entry from ICB location.
.TP
.B udf_read_file()
Read file data via allocation descriptors.
.SS Write Operations
.TP
.B udf_alloc_block(), udf_free_block()
Block allocation from space bitmap.
.TP
.B udf_create_fe()
Create new File Entry.
.TP
.B udf_write_file()
Write file data.
.TP
.B udf_add_fid(), udf_remove_fid()
Directory entry management.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I sys/fs/udf/udf.h
Structure definitions.
.TP
.I sys/fs/udf/udf.c
Read-only operations.
.TP
.I sys/fs/udf/udf_write.c
Write operations.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR udf (5),
.BR mount (2)
